@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description
[*] --> pending : start at event.atMs\nidentity (sourceTag, sourceEpoch, id)
pending --> satisfied : measured true observation\nbefore event.atMs + windowMs\n(sets satisfiedAtMs)
pending --> expired : window end reached\n(end is excluded)
satisfied --> [*] : explicit acknowledgement
expired --> [*] : explicit acknowledgement
note right of pending
  Cannot be acknowledged
  before its terminal boundary.
  Retained (max 32) until acknowledged.
end note
@enduml
